		gen2: { desc: "For 5 turns, the weather becomes Sandstorm. At the end of each turn except the last, all active Pokemon lose 1/8 of their maximum HP, rounded down, unless they are a Ground, Rock, or Steel type. Fails if the current weather is Sandstorm." }
